  "details": "The portal just looks like a regular portal.\n\nNormally, \"Community Labs\" portals have a green icon in the top right corner, and a green circle surrounding the portal.\n\nI don't remember when that changed, but I was surprised to see that the icon disappeared.\n\nEdit: Blue Cat checked out old \"Community Meetup\" footages and noticed that the icon disappeared between 02/19 and 03/19.\n\nAfter checking the patchnotes that came out between those dates, Blue Cat noticed that the March 9th 2023 patchnote made some changes related to portals, so the issue might have appeared after that update.",
